WEBVTT

00:00.760 --> 00:03.760
Nimechora umbo la pembe tatu hapa bila vipimo

00:03.760 --> 00:07.010
Nimeweka vipimo vya pembe za ndani.

00:07.010 --> 00:08.780
Kipimo cha hii pembe ni x.

00:08.780 --> 00:09.580
Hii hapa ni y

00:09.580 --> 00:10.750
Hii hapa ni z

00:10.750 --> 00:12.830
Ninachotaka kuthibitisha ni kwamba

00:12.830 --> 00:15.960
jumla ya pembe zote za ndani za pembe tatu, yaani x

00:15.960 --> 00:20.410
jumlisha y jumlisha z ni sawa na nyuzi 180.

00:20.410 --> 00:22.245
Na kwa jinsi nitakavyofanya

00:22.245 --> 00:25.050
ni kwa kutumia dhana ya mistari sambamba,

00:25.050 --> 00:26.660
au mikingamo ya mistari sambamba,

00:26.660 --> 00:28.600
na pembe husika.

00:28.600 --> 00:30.407
Ili kufanya hivyo, nitaongeza

00:30.407 --> 00:32.740
kila pande za hili pembe tatu, ambalo kwa sasa hivi

00:32.740 --> 00:35.370
lina vipande vya mistari, lakini nitaviongeza kuwa mistari.

00:35.370 --> 00:39.000
Kwa hiyo huu upande hapa chini, kama

00:39.000 --> 00:44.320
kama nikiendelea kuuongeza mwelekeo huu huu

00:44.320 --> 00:49.220
kisha ghafla kuna mstari wa rangi ya machungwa.

00:49.220 --> 00:51.750
Ninachotaka kufanya ni kuongeza mstari mwingine

00:51.750 --> 00:54.140
ambao ni sambamba na mstari wa rangi ya machungwa

00:54.140 --> 00:58.070
ambao unakatisha kwenye hii pembe ya pembe tatu hapa.

00:58.070 --> 00:59.860
Ngoja nifanye hivyo.

00:59.860 --> 01:01.390
Ngoja nianzie kwenye hii alama,

01:01.390 --> 01:03.520
na kufuata mwelekeo huohuo wa mstari huu

01:03.520 --> 01:04.760
na haizitakutana.

01:04.760 --> 01:09.210
Hazikaribiani wala kuzidi kuachana

01:09.210 --> 01:13.710
Kwa hiyo sitaukutanisha huu mstari.

01:13.710 --> 01:16.900
Kwa hiyo hii mistari miwili hapa ni sambamba.

01:16.900 --> 01:19.780
Huu ni sambamba na huu.

01:19.780 --> 01:21.280
Kisha nitaenda kwenye pande zingine mbili

01:21.280 --> 01:25.660
za umbo langu la pembe tatu na kuiongeza mistari.

01:25.660 --> 01:27.860
Kwa hiyo, nitaongeza hiki kipande na kuwa mstari.

01:27.860 --> 01:30.504
Nafanya kwa uangalifu sana.

01:30.504 --> 01:32.170
Nitaongeza hiki kipande na kuwa mstari.

01:32.170 --> 01:36.390
kama unavyoona ni dhahiri ni mkingamo

01:36.390 --> 01:38.370
wa mistari miwili sambamba.

01:38.370 --> 01:42.670
Sasa kama tuna mkingamo hapa wa mistari sambamba,

01:42.670 --> 01:44.930
kwa hiyo lazima tuwe na pembe inayofanana

01:44.930 --> 01:47.260
Na tumeona kwamba hii pembe imetokea

01:47.260 --> 01:50.550
baada ya mistari kukutana na mstari wa chini wa rangi ya machungwa.

01:50.550 --> 01:52.160
je ni pembe gani inayofanana pale

01:52.160 --> 01:55.000
mstari unapokutana na mstari wa bluu hapa juu?

01:55.000 --> 01:57.360
Tunapata pembe gani mistari inapokutana juu upande wa kulia?

01:57.360 --> 02:02.470
Pembe inayopataikana upande wa juu kulia mistari inapokutana lazima iwe x.

02:02.470 --> 02:04.240
Kitu kingine kinachokujia akilini mwako ni,

02:04.240 --> 02:06.710
kwamba kuna pembe nyingine juu yenye x,

02:06.710 --> 02:08.600
na pembe nyingine lazima zilingane.

02:08.600 --> 02:10.400
Mkabala na haya makutano,

02:10.400 --> 02:12.740
una pembe hii hapa.

02:12.740 --> 02:14.010
Hizi pembe mbili ni mkabala.

02:14.010 --> 02:16.200
Kwa hiyo kama hii ina kipimo x, na hii pia

02:16.200 --> 02:18.424
lazima iwe na kipimo x pia.

02:18.424 --> 02:20.840
Turudie kufanya hivyo kwenye upande wa mwisho wa hii pembe tatu

02:20.840 --> 02:23.160
ambao bado hatujauongeza mstari.

02:23.160 --> 02:24.370
Hebu tufanye hivyo.

02:24.370 --> 02:26.380
Kwa hiyo kama tukichukua hii hapa.

02:26.380 --> 02:28.010
Tukaongeza.

02:28.010 --> 02:29.060
Kwa hiyo utakuwa mstari.

02:29.060 --> 02:31.710
Kwa hiyo sasa hivi umekutanisha mistari miwili sambamba

02:31.710 --> 02:34.220
kama mstari ilivyo kwenye mstari wa kijani.

02:34.220 --> 02:37.340
Halafu tunasema hebu angalia hii pembe y hapa

02:37.340 --> 02:39.990
imetokana na makutano ya mkingamo

02:39.990 --> 02:41.580
chini ya mstari sambamba.

02:41.580 --> 02:43.270
Je ni pembe gani inayolingana na hii hapa?

02:43.270 --> 02:45.940
Iko upande wa kushoto mwa makutano.

02:45.940 --> 02:48.060
Inaendana na pembe hii hapa,

02:48.060 --> 02:50.100
ambapo mstari wa kijani, mkingamo wa mstari wa kijani

02:50.100 --> 02:52.810
unapokutana na mstari sambamba wa bluu.

02:52.810 --> 02:54.380
Je pembe gani iko mkabala na hii?

02:54.380 --> 02:55.630
Vizuri, ni hii pembe.

02:55.630 --> 02:59.990
Kwa hiyo na hii itakuwa na kipimo y pia.

02:59.990 --> 03:02.890
Kwa hiyo sasa tunakaribia kufika mwisho kuthibitisha

03:02.890 --> 03:05.787
kwa sababu tutaona kwamba kipimo --tulichonacho

03:05.787 --> 03:06.870
kwenye hii pembe na hii pembe.

03:06.870 --> 03:08.340
Kipimo cha hapa ni x

03:08.340 --> 03:10.000
hapa ni z

03:10.000 --> 03:11.880
zote ni pembe zinazopakana.

03:11.880 --> 03:15.560
Kama tukichukua mistari ya nje inayotengeneza pembe

03:15.560 --> 03:17.780
na kutafuta pembe hii hapa

03:17.780 --> 03:22.220
je pembe hii pana ina kipimo gani?

03:22.220 --> 03:24.712
Itakuwa x jumlisha z.

03:27.300 --> 03:34.140
Na hii pembe inakamilisha hii pembe hapa

03:34.140 --> 03:36.380
ambayo ina kipimo y

03:36.380 --> 03:39.460
Kwa hiyo kipimo x--kipimo

03:39.460 --> 03:41.530
za hii pembe pana, ambayo ni x jumlisha z,

03:41.530 --> 03:44.570
jumlisha kipimo cha pembe ya mstari wa kijani, ambayo ni y

03:44.570 --> 03:47.110
lazima kiwe nyuzi 180 kwa sababu hizi

03:47.110 --> 03:49.080
pembe mbili zinakamilisha jumla ya hizo nyuzi.

03:49.080 --> 03:55.360
Kwa hiyo x--kipimo cha pembe pana, x jumlisha z,

03:55.360 --> 03:58.580
jumlisha kipimo cha pembe ya kijani, ambacho ni

03:58.580 --> 04:00.600
kinakamilisha pembe pana,

04:00.600 --> 04:05.229
lazima iwe na nyuzi 180 kwa sababu zinakamilisha nyuzi 180.

04:05.229 --> 04:06.770
Vizuri, tungeweza kuweka kumbukumbu kama

04:06.770 --> 04:08.050
tunataka kuweka kwenye mpangilio wa alfabeti

04:08.050 --> 04:09.310
Lakini tumeshamaliza kuthibitisha.

04:09.310 --> 04:10.860
Kipimo cha pembe za ndani

04:10.860 --> 04:13.260
za pembe tatu, x jumlisha z jumlisha y.

04:13.260 --> 04:16.800
Tungeweza kuandika hii kama x jumlisha y jumlisha z

04:16.800 --> 04:18.750
kama kukosekana kwa mpangilio wa alfabeti

04:18.750 --> 04:20.079
kunakufanya usijisikie vizuri.

04:20.079 --> 04:22.980
Tungeweza kuandika tena x jumlisha y jumlisha jumlisha z

04:22.980 --> 04:26.360
ni sawa na nyuzi 180.

04:26.360 --> 04:28.350
Tumemamaliza.
